%% State 05 — OrganizationUser membership status
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Updated 2026-07-27 (code-verified).
%% Source of truth: organization_users.status = pending/approved/rejected.

stateDiagram-v2
direction LR
    state entry <<choice>>
    [*] --> entry
    entry --> pending : inviteUser / create pending row with invited_by
    entry --> pending : requestJoin / create pending row with invited_by=null
    pending --> approved : acceptInvitation [invited_by set] / activate membership
    pending --> rejected : rejectInvitation [invited_by set] / retain decision
    pending --> approved : approveJoinRequest [invited_by null] / assign organization role
    pending --> rejected : rejectJoinRequest [invited_by null] / retain decision
    rejected --> pending : requestJoin / reset pending membership
    approved --> [*] : removeMembership / delete membership row

    note right of pending
        No separate join-request store.
        Built-in roles: org_owner, org_admin, org_member.
        Custom roles come from organizations.custom_roles.
        No separate invitation lifecycle entity exists in current runtime.
    end note
